OL,3,GNEWSA'Heartbreak' as caravans for
OL,4,Aneurodivergent children may be forced
OL,5,Ato close
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhat is believed to be Wales' only
OL,8,Fholiday accommodation for children with
OL,9,Fadditional needs could be forced to
OL,10,Fclose in the next few years because of
OL,11,Fthe age of the two caravans.
OL,13,FMother-of-six Niaomi Flewers, 39,
OL,14,Fcreated the colourful getaway spaces at
OL,15,FTrecco Bay Holiday Park, in Porthcawl,
OL,16,FBridgend county, after struggling to
OL,17,Ffind suitable places for her own
OL,18,Ffamily.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
