OL,3,GNEWSA'Heartbreak' as caravans for
OL,4,Aneurodivergent children may be forced
OL,5,Ato close
OL,6,
OL,7,FHowever, park rules aimed at
OL,8,Fmaintaining high standards of safety
OL,9,Fand quality mean individual caravans
OL,10,Fcan only stay for a maximum of 15 years
OL,11,Fbefore needing to be replaced.
OL,13,FFlewers estimates she will need around
OL,14,F#60,000 to replace the two caravans
OL,15,Fthat have provided help for
OL,16,Fneurodivergent families across Wales.
